Dear all,

Please save the date for our holiday party. Each office will hold its own party on Friday 11 December, starting at 18:00.

- London: the Riverside Rooms, a short walk from the office.
- Utrecht: restaurant De Kade, near the station.
- Cologne: the Brauhaus am Markt.

There will be dinner, drinks and music. Partners are welcome. Deliveries that Friday will finish at 14:00 so the drivers and warehouse teams can join us.

Emma, Lee and Jonas will help organise the parties in each office. A sign-up form will follow in October, with a question about food allergies and diets.

It has been a busy and good year, and I am looking forward to celebrating with you.

Kind regards,
Maria
